  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-bookshelf-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lieonlion?sub_confirmation=1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/youtube.svg\" alt=\"youtube\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/More-Bookshelf-Variants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fLieOnLion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/LieOnLion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/patreon.svg\" alt=\"patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieon-studios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-los-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>More Bookshelf Variants добавляет новые книжные шкафы для всех видов древесины.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/twjW6Ggd/images/a300ba1e540bbdcb46469c4334f9c385e4f8f009.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Особенности включают:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Питание столов зачарований</li>\n<li>Горят в огне (за исключением древесины Незера)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>А также поддержка Quad, включающая:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Топливо для печи (за исключением древесины Незера)</li>\n<li>Иммунитет к огню у древесины Незера</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisect.lieonlion.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/banners/bisect-banner-spruce-chest.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
